        IF `the case falls within the circumstances and purposes prescribed as exceptions` EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN JUST FALSE    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall (except in prescribed circumstances and for prescribed purposes) be disregarded"
